  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A food basket in the Republic of Mauritania for the year 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A number of (7,772) families, including approximately (46,632) individuals, obtained basic food supplies.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to achieving food security for the most needy groups by providing 7,772 food baskets to the targeted families in the beneficiary sector. These baskets were provided in one batch, allowing the beneficiary families to secure their food for a month.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the level of food security for the project&#x2019;s beneficiaries by distributing food baskets of basic materials sufficient for one family for a month.</narrative>
  </description>
